"This errand has been set to <style=\"KKeyword\">Top Priority</style>\n"
"\n"
"The colony will be in <style=\"KKeyword\">Yellow Alert</style> until this task is completed"
msgstr ""
"งาน​นี้​ถูก​ตั้ง​เป็น<style=\"KKeyword\">ความสำคัญ​สูงสุด</style>\n"
"\n"
