"A Duplicant with zero remaining <style=\"KKeyword\">Breath</style> will become incapacitated and die unless they are rescued\n"
"\n"
"Duplicants can increase their <style=\"KKeyword\">Maximum Breath</style> by learning the <style=\"KKeyword\">Basic Swimming</style> skill"
