#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.DRYSUIT.RECIPE_DESC_DLC3
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.DRYSUIT.RECIPE_DESC_DLC3"
msgid ""
"Protects the wearer from  <style=\"KKeyword\">Soggy Feet</style> and <style=\"KKeyword\">Sopping Wet</style> effects.\n"
"\n"
"Enables Bionic Duplicants to cross waist-deep pools without <style=\"KKeyword\">Liquid Exposure</style> damage."
