#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.TOFU.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.TOFU.DESC"
msgid ""
"A bland curd made from <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Nosh Beans</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It has an unusual but pleasant consistency."
msgstr ""
"นม​ถั่ว​จับตัว​รสจืด​ทำ​จาก<link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">ถั่ว​กิน​เล่น</link>\n"
