#. STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.ORBITAL_RESEARCH_DATABANK.RECIPE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.ORBITAL_RESEARCH_DATABANK.RECIPE_DESC"
msgid ""
"Data Banks of raw data generated from exploring, either by exploring new areas with Duplicants, or by using an <link=\"ORBITALRESEARCHCENTER\">Orbital Data Collection Lab</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Used by the <link=\"DLC1COSMICRESEARCHCENTER\">Virtual Planetarium</link> to conduct research."
msgstr ""
"แบงก์​ข้อมูลดิบ​ที่​ได้​จาก​การสำรวจ ไม่​ว่า​จะ​ให้​ดู​พลิ​แคนต์​ไป​สำรวจ​พื้นที่​ใหม่ หรือ​ใช้<link=\"ORBITALRESEARCHCENTER\">แล็บ​เก็บ​ข้อมูล​วงโคจร</link>\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"DLC1COSMICRESEARCHCENTER\">ท้องฟ้า​จำลอง​เสมือน</link>ใช้​สิ่ง​นี้​ใน​การวิจัย"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.PLANKTON_CORAL_PRODUCT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.PLANKTON_CORAL_PRODUCT.DESC"
msgid ""
"A chunk of hardened mineral.\n"
"\n"
"It can be eaten by <link=\"PARROTFISHSPECIES\">Beakons</link>, or processed into various useful items."
