msgid ""
"A bundle of dried plant matter.\n"
"\n"
"It can be eaten by <link=\"MOOSPECIES\">Moos</link>, or processed into <link=\"POWER\">fuel</link> or <link=\"BUILDINGMATERIALCLASSES\">building materials</link>."
