#. STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.PLASTIC_GASKET.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.PLASTIC_GASKET.DESC"
msgid ""
"A flexible <link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">Plastic</link> seal, made at the <link=\"CRAFTINGTABLE\">Crafting Station</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Prevents unwanted <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquid</link> leakage."
